sequenceDiagram
  participant H as Human Engineer
  participant UI as Frontend UI
  participant API as ForgeOS API
  participant C as Optimization Core
  participant A as Evaluation Adapter
  participant R as Run Store

  H->>UI: Define objective, constraints, and budget
  UI->>API: Start optimization run
  API->>C: Initialize seeded run
  loop Until stop condition
    C->>A: Evaluate candidate
    A-->>C: Objectives + constraints + status
    C->>R: Persist trial with feasibility state
    C->>C: Update next candidate policy
  end
  C-->>API: Best feasible result and diagnostics
  API-->>UI: Render run report and trade-offs
